  {"line":3,"text":"Put every number into a **hash set**. Now *is x present?* is answered in O(1), and duplicates disappear.","views":[{"t":"array","id":"nums","title":"nums","cells":[{"v":"100"},{"v":"4"},{"v":"200"},{"v":"1"},{"v":"3"},{"v":"2"}]},{"t":"map","id":"num_set","title":"num_set","kind":"set","entries":[{"k":"1"},{"k":"2"},{"k":"3"},{"k":"4"},{"k":"100"},{"k":"200"}]}]},
  {"line":7,"text":"Take 1. Is 0 in the set? No — nothing comes right before 1, so it **starts** a run.","views":[{"t":"array","id":"nums","title":"nums","cells":[{"v":"100"},{"v":"4"},{"v":"200"},{"v":"1"},{"v":"3"},{"v":"2"}]},{"t":"map","id":"num_set","title":"num_set","kind":"set","entries":[{"k":"1","tone":"cur"},{"k":"2"},{"k":"3"},{"k":"4"},{"k":"100"},{"k":"200"}]},{"t":"vars","id":"vars","items":[{"k":"max_length","v":"0"}]}]},
  {"line":13,"text":"2 is in the set too, so the run grows: 1 … 2, length **2**.","views":[{"t":"array","id":"nums","title":"nums","cells":[{"v":"100"},{"v":"4"},{"v":"200"},{"v":"1"},{"v":"3"},{"v":"2"}]},{"t":"map","id":"num_set","title":"num_set","kind":"set","entries":[{"k":"1","tone":"good"},{"k":"2","tone":"good"},{"k":"3"},{"k":"4"},{"k":"100"},{"k":"200"}]},{"t":"vars","id":"vars","items":[{"k":"current_num","v":"2"},{"k":"current_length","v":"2"},{"k":"max_length","v":"0"}]}]},
